Z||000000||2M4 Dale||10-28-2000||12:21 AM||||There was a Ford GT40/Fiero rebody at the Fiero Festival this past summer. It was yellow and not quite finished. I seen it...I know it was there...I have photos.lol. Does anyone know who makes this kit ? <P>The one at the show was for sale. Does anyone know who the owner was/is ?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||10-28-2000||04:50 AM||||Dale,<P>Was the plate #GT 40 ? If so I saw it at Twin Lakes this year. (Yellow with a HELL of a good sounding engine) Its made by ASPP (520)689-0100.<P>Carl<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif"> <BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A>-                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||10
